index 7a3126a..c3328c0 100644
--- a/docs/business-rules.md
+++ b/docs/business-rules.md
@@ -55,6 +55,21 @@ ### User Roles
 - Owner cannot be removed while being owner; transfer ownership before downgrading or deleting.
 - Only owner accesses billing, plan and payment data.
 
+## Authentication (staff accounts)
+
+Session-based, written in the app (no starter kit): Livewire full-page `login` and `register` (guests only), plain controllers for logout, password reset and e-mail verification. All screen text lives in `lang/{pt_BR,en}/ui.php`.
+
+| Rule | Detail |
+| ---- | ------ |
+| Login | E-mail (RFC-strict, `User::EMAIL_RULES`) + password + remember me. Failed attempts are limited to **5** per lowercase e-mail + IP; a locked attempt returns `auth.throttle` on `email`. Success regenerates the session and redirects to the intended URL or `home`. |
+| Register | Name, e-mail (unique, stored lowercase), password + confirmation. **5** submissions per IP (invalid ones count, so `unique` can't enumerate e-mails). Creates an **unverified** user, fires `Registered` (verification mail), logs in, regenerates the session. |
+| Password rule | `Password::defaults()` (`AppServiceProvider`): min 8, letters, mixed case, numbers. Used by register and reset. |
+| Logout | `POST /logout`, authenticated only; invalidates the session and regenerates the CSRF token. |
+| Home | `/home` requires `auth` + `verified`: guests go to `login`, unverified users to `verification.notice`. Logged-in users visiting `login`/`register` go to `home`. |
+| Forgot password | Always answers with the same `status` flash (never reveals whether the e-mail exists); `throttle:6,1`. |
+| Reset password | Validates token, e-mail and the default rule; rotates `remember_token`, fires `PasswordReset`, redirects to `login`. An unknown e-mail gets the invalid-token error. |
+| E-mail verification | `User` implements `MustVerifyEmail`. Signed + throttled link verifies only the logged-in user (tampered id/hash → 403). Resend is throttled and a no-op (redirect to `home`) for verified users. |
+
